    "rationale": "The d809 root put only libunwind, elfutils, zlib and openssl on LIBRARY_PATH. Reverie b8ef6a829634 made reverie-ptrace's build script request libunwind-ptrace's --static pkg-config closure, whose Libs.private names -llzma, so linking any crate that depends on reverie-ptrace failed with `unable to find library -llzma` although liblzma was already in the image closure. This replacement adds xz to nativeLibs, which puts liblzma on LIBRARY_PATH, PKG_CONFIG_PATH and CPATH. Two new independent physical stores reproduced archive 085b60 byte-for-byte and loaded as d4e5."
  },
